<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n21640" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">imbrĭco</span></b> , no <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>perf.</i>, ātum,
			1, v. a.
			imbrex. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>To cover with gutter-tiles</i> (postclass.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">tegulis interjacentibus imbricarentur,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sid. Ep. 2, 2</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>To form like a gutter-tile</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">caementa inter se,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Vitr. 2,
					8</span></i>
			.—In <i>part. perf.</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">laurus folio per margines imbricato,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					15, 30, 39, § 127</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ungues simiae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					11, 45, 101, § 247</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vertebrae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. 11,
					1, 1, § 1</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
